*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can beat this stage by spamming [[Super Mr.]]

==Trivia==
*U-Don Domain is named after [[wikipedia:Udon|udon]], a type of Japanese noodle.
**In Japanese, U-Don Domain's name is different from how ''udon'' would normally be spelled. Rather than うどん or 饂飩, the stage uses 卯 (the rabbit zodiac sign) for ''u'' and 曇 (cloudy weather) for ''don''. These two kanji are part of the word 卯月曇 ''uzukigumori'' (cloudy weather during the month of the rabbit).

